DDIC Table Definition: ZCUST_ORDER_HEADER
Table Type: Transparent table
Delivery Class: A

Fields:
  MANDT    MANDT     3  Client
  ORDER_ID CHAR      20 Order ID (Key)
  CUST_ID  CHAR      10 Customer ID
  STATUS   CHAR      2  Order Status
  CREATED  DATS      8  Creation Date
  AMOUNT   CURR      15 Order Amount
